      "description": "Watch Tigre vs Belgrano Cordoba highlights and goals from Argentine Primera División on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 6, 2026. A Tense Clash in the Liga Profesional On August 6, 2026, Tigre and Belgrano de Córdoba met in a pivotal encounter for the Liga Profesional Argentina . The match was characterized by a grueling physical battle as both sides fought for control in a contest where space was at a premium. Drama Down the Stretch As the second half progressed, the discipline of the visitors began to fray. The pivotal moment arrived in the 87th minute when Adrian Sanchez was sent off after receiving a second yellow card, forcing Belgrano to navigate the final moments with ten men. The numerical advantage gave Tigre a surge of momentum, leading to a golden opportunity in the 89th minute when they were awarded a penalty. Alfio Oviedo stepped up to the spot, but his miss proved to be the final heartbreak of the night. Despite a frantic finish, neither team could break the deadlock, leaving them to share the points."
